## Architecture & Design

We are designing a vehicle factory 
Vehicles are made of 

Automobile: 
    engine: turns on/off
    wheels: accelerates (engine must be on), turns the car (engine must be on)
    break: decelerate
Plane: 
    engine: turns on/off
    wings: ascend/descend (engine must be on), to take off wheels must be accelerating
    wheels: accelerates (engine must be on)
    breaks: decelerate
Train:
    engine: turns on/off
    wheels: accelerates (engine must be on)
    breaks: decelerate

Objective:
    design a vehicle factory that:
        creates the parts
        assembles them
        tests all functionality

Compile from vehicleFactory/
    javac -d bin (Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter *.java).FullName

Run tests from vehicleFactory/
    java -cp bin Practice.vehicleFactory.src.tests.java.CarFunctionTest
    java -cp bin Practice.vehicleFactory.src.tests.java.TrainFunctionTest
    java -cp bin Practice.vehicleFactory.src.tests.java.PlaneFunctionTest